# Pruebas de la API KipuPOS. Funciona en Visual Studio 2022 (17.8+) y en VS Code con la extensión "REST Client".
# Ejecuta cada bloque con "Send request", EN ORDEN. Cambia @today y @tomorrow por la fecha real (hora de Lima).
#
# Flujo: usuario de plataforma -> crea un negocio -> administrador del negocio -> sucursal, catálogo, cajero -> ventas.
# Los dos primeros inicios de sesión usan la contraseña temporal; el cambio de contraseña devuelve un token ya válido.

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7100
@today = 2026-10-09
@tomorrow = 2026-10-10
@tenant = cafe-demo
@saleId = 3f2b8a7e-5c1d-4e9a-9b6f-1a2b3c4d5e6f
@saleId2 = 5a6b7c8d-9e0f-4a1b-8c2d-3e4f5a6b7c8d

### 0. Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Login de plataforma (SIN código de negocio). Usuario y clave de Seed en appsettings
# @name loginPlatform
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "platform", "password": "CambiarAhora#2026" }

### 2. Plataforma cambia su contraseña (obligatorio la primera vez)
# @name platformAuth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPlatform.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "CambiarAhora#2026", "newPassword": "Plataforma#Nueva2026" }

### 3. Plataforma crea un negocio (negocio + sucursal "Principal" + administrador)
# @name newTenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{tenant}}", "name": "Cafetería Demo", "ruc": null, "branchName": "Principal", "adminUsername": "dueno", "adminFullName": "Dueño Demo" }

### 4. Login del administrador del negocio (con código de negocio y la contraseña temporal)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantCode": "{{tenant}}", "username": "dueno", "password": "{{newTenant.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}" }

### 5. El administrador cambia su contraseña
# @name adminAuth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{newTenant.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}", "newPassword": "Dueno#Nuevo2026" }

### 6. Datos del negocio y sucursales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
# @name branches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 6b. Crear una segunda sucursal
# @name branch2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sucursal Miraflores", "address": "Av. Larco 123", "active": true }

### 7. Catálogo: categoría y producto (precio SIN IGV)
# @name cat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cafés", "sortOrder": 1, "active": true }

###
# @name product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{cat.response.body.$.id}}", "name": "Cappuccino", "price": 10.00, "active": true }

### 8. Crear cajero en la sucursal Principal (devuelve contraseña temporal)
# @name newUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Lucía Paredes", "username": "lucia", "role": "Cajero", "branchId": "{{newTenant.response.body.$.branch.id}}" }

### 8b. Cajero sin sucursal: debe dar 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Sin Sucursal", "username": "sinsucursal", "role": "Cajero", "branchId": null }

### 9. Login del cajero y cambio de contraseña
# @name loginCashier
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantCode": "{{tenant}}", "username": "lucia", "password": "{{newUser.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}" }

###
# @name cashierAuth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCashier.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{newUser.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}", "newPassword": "Lucia#Nuevo2026" }

### 10. Abrir turno de caja (fondo S/ 100). La sucursal es la del cajero
# @name session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/open
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "openingCash": 100.00 }

### 10b. Abrir otro turno debe dar 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/open
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "openingCash": 50.00 }

### 11. Venta de 2 cappuccinos. Esperado: subtotal 20.00, IGV 3.60, total 23.60, number 1
# Enviarla una SEGUNDA vez debe devolver 200 con la misma venta (idempotencia), no duplicarla.
# @name sale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{saleId}}",
  "cashSessionId": "{{session.response.body.$.id}}",
  "createdAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "paymentMethod": "Efectivo",
  "lines": [ { "productId": "{{product.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 2, "note": "sin azúcar" } ]
}

### 12. Ventas del turno, detalle y reimpresión (queda auditada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}/reprint
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 13. MENÚ DEL DÍA: categoría, dos platos (precio habitual sin IGV) y táper
# @name menuCat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Menú", "sortOrder": 9, "active": true }

###
# @name dishA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{menuCat.response.body.$.id}}", "name": "Ají de gallina", "price": 12.00, "active": true, "isMenuItem": true }

###
# @name dishB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{menuCat.response.body.$.id}}", "name": "Lomo saltado", "price": 14.00, "active": true, "isMenuItem": true }

###
# @name taper
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{menuCat.response.body.$.id}}", "name": "Táper", "price": 1.00, "active": true }

### 13b. Vender un plato SIN menú cargado: debe dar 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "0b1c2d3e-4f50-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d",
  "cashSessionId": "{{session.response.body.$.id}}",
  "createdAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "paymentMethod": "Efectivo",
  "lines": [ { "productId": "{{dishA.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 13c. El admin carga el menú de HOY en su sucursal (precios distintos por plato)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/{{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "entries": [
  { "productId": "{{dishA.response.body.$.id}}", "price": 12.00 },
  { "productId": "{{dishB.response.body.$.id}}", "price": 14.00 }
] }

### 13d. Menú de hoy (cajero)
# @name menuToday
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/today
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 13e. Venta para llevar: Lomo saltado (14.00) + Táper (1.00). Esperado: subtotal 15.00, IGV 2.70, total 17.70, number 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{saleId2}}",
  "cashSessionId": "{{session.response.body.$.id}}",
  "createdAtUtc": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "paymentMethod": "Yape",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{dishB.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": "{{taper.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 13f. El cajero marca un plato como agotado (solo hoy y su sucursal)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/entries/{{menuToday.response.body.$.entries[0].id}}/sold-out
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "soldOut": true }

### 13g. El cajero NO puede cargar el menú: debe dar 403
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/{{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "entries": [] }

### 13h. El admin copia el menú de hoy a mañana
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu/{{tomorrow}}/copy-from/{{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 14. Anular sin motivo: debe dar 400. Con motivo: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Error de cobro" }

### 14b. Reimprimir una anulada: debe dar 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId}}/reprint
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 15. Resumen y cierre del turno
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session.response.body.$.id}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session.response.body.$.id}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "countedCash": 100.00, "note": "prueba" }

### 16. Admin: ventas anuladas, resumen, más vendidos, cierres y usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?status=Voided
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/summary?from={{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}&to={{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/top-products?from={{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}&to={{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 17. PERMISOS. El cajero NO ve usuarios: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 17b. El administrador de un negocio NO entra a plataforma: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 17c. Plataforma NO opera dentro de un negocio: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 18. AISLAMIENTO ENTRE NEGOCIOS. Crear un segundo negocio
# @name otherTenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "otro-negocio", "name": "Otro Negocio", "ruc": null, "branchName": "Principal", "adminUsername": "dueno", "adminFullName": "Otro Dueño" }

###
# @name otherLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantCode": "otro-negocio", "username": "dueno", "password": "{{otherTenant.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}" }

###
# @name otherAuth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{otherLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{otherTenant.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}", "newPassword": "Otro#Nuevo2026" }

### 18a. El otro negocio NO ve productos ni usuarios del primero: lista vacía / solo los suyos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 18b. ... ni una venta del primero por su id: debe dar 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/{{saleId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 18c. ... ni crear un producto en una categoría del primero: debe dar 400 ("Categoría inexistente")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{cat.response.body.$.id}}", "name": "Intruso", "price": 1.00 }

### 18d. El usuario "dueno" existe en los dos negocios (único POR negocio). Cada token ve su propio negocio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
Authorization: Bearer {{otherAuth.response.body.$.token}}

### 19. Plataforma: lista de negocios y suspender uno (suspendido no puede iniciar sesión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAuth.response.body.$.token}}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/tenants/{{otherTenant.response.body.$.tenant.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{platformAuth.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Otro Negocio", "ruc": null, "active": false }
